      "title": "Advanced - PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Create an original illustration of Laema following the request below. Image 1 supplies her identity and costume. Image 2 supplies the saved hammer design when the request includes her hammer. Keep her recognizable face, platinum-white high ponytail, blue sleeveless waistcoat, cream rolled-sleeve shirt, red waist sash, brown trousers, leather strap/pouch, fingerless gloves and brown boots unless the request explicitly changes them. Render clear anatomy, convincing materials, finely modeled volumes and expressive facial drawing. No text or watermark. Follow the requested pose, framing, setting and lighting.\n\nUSER REQUEST:\n"
